---
import SessionsGrid from "../../components/SessionsGrid.astro";
import { courseMeta } from "../../course-config";
import CourseLayout from "../../layouts/CourseLayout.astro";
---

<CourseLayout
  title="Consultation"
  description="A small case clinic for bringing an everyday care problem through observation, evidence and a safe owner-level response."
  pageClass="course-shell-page"
>
  <section class="shell-hero shell-hero--consultation" aria-labelledby="consultation-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">{courseMeta.code} · Case clinic</p>
      <h1 id="consultation-title">Bring a problem. Leave with a safer next step.</h1>
    </div>
    <p>
      Consultation is where the Capture method travels into a new household. It is not another
      lecture sequence: one case, one uncertain pattern, and a decision that must stay within an
      owner's real scope.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="consultation-method" aria-labelledby="consultation-method-title">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">The working rhythm</p>
      <h2 id="consultation-method-title">A story becomes a usable record</h2>
    </header>
    <ol>
      <li><span>01</span><strong>Observe</strong><p>Separate the visible pattern from the household's first explanation.</p></li>
      <li><span>02</span><strong>Reason</strong><p>Compare the cat with her own baseline and keep plausible alternatives open.</p></li>
      <li><span>03</span><strong>Consult</strong><p>Use course evidence with its limits visible, including what cannot be decided at home.</p></li>
      <li><span>04</span><strong>Respond</strong><p>Choose a proportionate action, a monitoring endpoint and an escalation boundary.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="consultation-cases" aria-labelledby="consultation-cases-title">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Case library</p>
      <h2 id="consultation-cases-title">Start with one complete case</h2>
      <p>More cases are not useful until this one proves the transfer method works.</p>
    </header>
    <SessionsGrid />
  </section>

  <aside class="scope-note" aria-labelledby="scope-note-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Course boundary</p>
    <h2 id="scope-note-title">This is reasoning practice, not a clinical service</h2>
    <p>
      Consultation cases teach description, comparison and safe escalation. They do not diagnose a
      cat, prescribe treatment or replace timely advice from a veterinarian.
    </p>
  </aside>
</CourseLayout>
